---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Download"
  description="Install BeekeeperML on your home lab server in minutes."
>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-inner">
      <h1>Get BeekeeperML</h1>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Requirements</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Python 3.10+</li>
          <li>Git</li>
          <li>Linux server with systemd (tested on Ubuntu)</li>
          <li>GPU optional but recommended</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Install</h2>
        <p>
          Clone the repo and run the setup script. It creates a virtual environment,
          installs dependencies, and registers a systemd service.
        </p>
        <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/bobcowher/beekeeper.git
cd beekeeper
bash setup.sh</code></pre>
        <p>
          Once complete, BeekeeperML is running on port 5000.
          Open <code>http://your-server:5000</code> in a browser.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Connect an AI agent (MCP)</h2>
        <p>Install the MCP server:</p>
        <pre><code>pip install beekeeper-mcp</code></pre>
        <p>Register it with Claude Code:</p>
        <pre><code>claude mcp add beekeeper -s user \
  -e BEEKEEPER_HOST=http://your-server:5000 \
  -- beekeeper-mcp</code></pre>
        <p>
          If auth is enabled on your server, add
          <code>-e BEEKEEPER_API_KEY=your-key</code> before <code>--</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="btn btn-primary">Full setup guide →</a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .page-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .section ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  pre {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #f0f0f0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
    font-family: 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', 'Consolas', monospace;
  }

  code {
    font-family: 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', 'Consolas', monospace;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    background: #f0f0f0;
    padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  pre code {
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
</style>
